MODULE: TypeOKClearOutsideDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: environment clearance writes an impossible partition identity
PERTURBS: CauseOff

--- FIND
    /\ input' = [input EXCEPT ![t] = EmptyInput]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: clearance corrupts partition identity.
    /\ input' = [input EXCEPT ![t] = [EmptyInput EXCEPT !.partition = 0]]
--- END
